{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Therefore you shall not bring.</b> לכן means nothing but the language of an oath, as in what is said: לכן נשבעתי לבית עלי. And proof for this: וישבע לבלתי עברי. And if you ask: but in the portion of Shemot Rashi explained 'לכן עתה תראה את אשר אעשה לפרעה' — but not when I bring them into the land — if so, it implies that the decree resulted from the sin of saying למה הרעות? One may answer: this and this caused it."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:18:48.298449059Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}